doi: 10.3390/ijms24043532. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 13. Hohenstein P., Pritchard-Jones K., Charlton J. The yin and yang of kidney development and Wilms’ tumors. Genes Dev. 2015;29:467–482. doi: 10.1101/gad.256396.114. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 14. Krasnova O., Gursky V., Chabina A., Kulakova K., Alekseenko L., Panova A., Kiselev S., Neganova I. Prognostic Analysis of Human Pluripotent Stem Cells Based on Their Morphological Portrait and Expression of Pluripotent Markers. Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2022;23:12902. doi: 10.3390/ijms232112902. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 15. Rowe R.G., Daley G.Q. Induced pluripotent stem cells in disease modelling and drug discovery. Nat. Rev. Genet. 2019;20:377–388. doi: 10.1038/s41576-019-0100-z. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 16. Melamud M., Ermakov E., Boiko A., Kamaeva D., Sizikov A., Ivanova S., Baulina N., Favorova O., Nevinsky G., Buneva V. Multiplex Analysis of Serum Cytokine Profiles in Systemic Lupus Erythematosus and Multiple Sclerosis. Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2022;23:13829. doi: 10.3390/ijms232213829. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 17. Melamud M.M., Ermakov E.A., Boiko A.S., Parshukova D.A., Sizikov A.E., Ivanova S.A., Nevinsky G.A., Buneva V.N. Serum cytokine levels of systemic lupus erythematosus patients in the presence of concomitant cardiovascular diseases. Endocr. Metab. Immune Disord. Drug Targets. 2022;22:852–861. doi: 10.2174/1871530322666220304214512. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 18. Shevtsov A., Raevskiy M., Stupnikov A., Medvedeva Y. In Silico Drug Repurposing in Multiple Sclerosis Using scRNA-Seq Data. Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2023;24:985. doi: 10.3390/ijms24020985. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Raevskiy M., Yanvarev V., Jung S., Del Sol A., Medvedeva Y.A. Epi-Impute: Single-Cell RNA-seq Imputation via Integration with Single-Cell ATAC-seq. Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2023;24:6229. doi: 10.3390/ijms24076229. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Danilchenko V., Zytsar M., Maslova E., Posukh O. Selection of Diagnostically Significant Regions of the SLC26A4 Gene Involved in Hearing Loss. Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2022;23:13453. doi: 10.3390/ijms232113453. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 21. Bai H., Liu H., Suyalatu S., Guo X., Chu S., Chen Y., Lan T., Borjigin B., Orlov Y.L., Posukh O.L., et al. Association analysis of genetic variants with type 2 diabetes in a Mongolian population in China. J. Diabetes Res. 2015;2015:613236. doi: 10.1155/2015/613236. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 22. Saik O., Klimontov V. Gene Networks of Hyperglycemia, Diabetic Complications, and Human Proteins Targeted by SARS-CoV-2: What Is the Molecular Basis for Comorbidity? Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2022;23:7247. doi: 10.3390/ijms23137247. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Ivanisenko T., Demenkov P., Kolchanov N., Ivanisenko V. The New Version of the ANDDigest Tool with Improved AI-Based Short Names Recognition. Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2022;23:14934. doi: 10.3390/ijms232314934. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 24. Ivanisenko V.A., Saik O.V., Ivanisenko N.V., Tiys E.S., Ivanisenko T.V., Demenkov P.S., Kolchanov N.A. ANDSystem: An Associative Network Discovery System for automated literature mining in the field of biology. BMC Syst. Biol. 2015;9((Suppl. S2)):S2. doi: 10.1186/1752-0509-9-S2-S2. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 25. Gerasimov A., Lebedev G., Lebedev M., Semenycheva I. COVID-19 Dynamics: A Heterogeneous Model. Front Public Health. 2021;8:558368. doi: 10.3389/fpubh.2020.558368. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 26. Lebedev G., Fartushnyi E., Fartushnyi I., Shaderkin I., Klimenko H., Kozhin P., Koshechkin K., Ryabkov I., Tarasov V., Morozov E. Fomina I. Technology of S